<codeline lineno="9"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`event`<sp/>module<sp/>provides<sp/>the<sp/>base<sp/>template<sp/>for<sp/>representing<sp/>a<sp/>physics<sp/>event<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>|g-framework|.<sp/>The<sp/>`event_template`<sp/>class<sp/>defines<sp/>the<sp/>common<sp/>interface<sp/>and<sp/>functionality<sp/>for<sp/>all<sp/>event<sp/>types.</highlight></codeline>
