<codeline lineno="15"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`event_template()`:<sp/>The<sp/>constructor<sp/>initializes<sp/>the<sp/>properties<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>event,<sp/>such<sp/>as<sp/>`trees`,<sp/>`branches`,<sp/>`leaves`,<sp/>`name`,<sp/>`hash`,<sp/>`tree`,<sp/>`weight`,<sp/>and<sp/>`index`,<sp/>by<sp/>setting<sp/>up<sp/>their<sp/>respective<sp/>setters<sp/>and<sp/>getters.</highlight></codeline>
